MODULE: ARITHMETIC_REASONING

OBJECTIVE:
Teach AFOQT Arithmetic Reasoning through word problems and timed quantitative reasoning.

TOPIC_FAMILIES:
- ArithmeticWordProblems
- GeometryApplications
- Proportions
- Ratios
- Mixtures
- Integers
- Percentages
- TimeDistanceRate
- UnitConversions
- ScaleConversions
- VolumeApplications
- PercentOfTotal
- MultiStepReasoning

QUESTION_PATTERNS:
- FindDistanceGivenRateAndTime
- FindRateGivenDistanceAndTime
- FindTimeGivenDistanceAndRate
- SolveRatioComparison
- SolvePartWholePercent
- SolveMixtureOrCombinedValue
- ConvertUnitsInsideProblem
- UseGeometryFormulaInWordProblem

TEACHING_RULES:
- TranslateWordsFirst
- IdentifyUnknown
- EstimateBeforeSolving
- SolveStepByStep
- CheckReasonableness
